1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,333
These pills made baby

2
00:00:01,426 --> 00:00:02,852
mice into dwarfs.

3
00:00:03,009 --> 00:00:04,194
Not clickbait:

4
00:00:04,269 --> 00:00:05,602
dwarfism is the actual

5
00:00:05,694 --> 00:00:06,713
word in the paper.

6
00:00:06,824 --> 00:00:07,861
Ibuprofen,

7
00:00:07,935 --> 00:00:08,676
aspirin,

8
00:00:08,787 --> 00:00:09,343
naproxen.

9
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:10,241
They all block an

10
00:00:10,333 --> 00:00:11,444
enzyme called COX.

11
00:00:11,602 --> 00:00:12,102
COX makes

12
00:00:12,176 --> 00:00:13,361
prostaglandins,

13
00:00:13,435 --> 00:00:14,546
and prostaglandins do

14
00:00:14,639 --> 00:00:15,972
way more than pain.

15
00:00:16,083 --> 00:00:17,120
Your bones get longer

16
00:00:17,194 --> 00:00:18,361
in one place:

17
00:00:18,435 --> 00:00:19,435
the growth plate.

18
00:00:19,593 --> 00:00:20,704
A strip of cartilage

19
00:00:20,815 --> 00:00:21,963
where cells divide,

20
00:00:22,037 --> 00:00:22,778
swell up,

21
00:00:22,852 --> 00:00:23,796
and get replaced by

22
00:00:23,889 --> 00:00:24,370
bone.

23
00:00:24,481 --> 00:00:25,815
In 2015,

24
00:00:25,889 --> 00:00:26,926
researchers found this

25
00:00:27,019 --> 00:00:28,204
cartilage is packed with

26
00:00:28,278 --> 00:00:29,389
COX-2,

27
00:00:29,463 --> 00:00:30,926
and IGF-1 pushes it

28
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:31,944
even higher.

29
00:00:32,102 --> 00:00:32,750
Block COX,

30
00:00:32,824 --> 00:00:33,639
and the cells stop

31
00:00:33,713 --> 00:00:34,454
dividing.

32
00:00:34,611 --> 00:00:36,500
ERK signalling drops.

33
00:00:36,657 --> 00:00:38,843
Add PGE2 or prostacyclin

34
00:00:38,917 --> 00:00:39,361
back,

35
00:00:39,398 --> 00:00:40,620
and the signal returns.

36
00:00:40,778 --> 00:00:41,889
Same paper:

37
00:00:42,046 --> 00:00:43,046
inject these drugs into

38
00:00:43,120 --> 00:00:43,935
young mice,

39
00:00:43,972 --> 00:00:45,269
and you get dwarfism.

40
00:00:45,380 --> 00:00:46,602
2006.

41
00:00:46,759 --> 00:00:48,296
Rat growth plate cells.

42
00:00:48,454 --> 00:00:49,417
Indomethacin,

43
00:00:49,565 --> 00:00:50,454
ketorolac,

44
00:00:50,565 --> 00:00:51,417
diclofenac,

45
00:00:51,491 --> 00:00:52,231
piroxicam.

46
00:00:52,389 --> 00:00:53,278
Division down.

47
00:00:53,435 --> 00:00:54,694
Cell cycle frozen.

48
00:00:54,852 --> 00:00:55,833
Cells dying.

49
00:00:55,991 --> 00:00:56,435
And adding

50
00:00:56,509 --> 00:00:57,861
prostaglandins back did

51
00:00:57,935 --> 00:00:58,843
not save them.

52
00:00:59,000 --> 00:00:59,741
So part of this

53
00:00:59,815 --> 00:01:01,315
isn't even about COX.

54
00:01:01,472 --> 00:01:03,176
Nobody fully knows why.

55
00:01:03,287 --> 00:01:04,546
2011:

56
00:01:04,620 --> 00:01:06,769
COX-2 works with BMP-2

57
00:01:06,861 --> 00:01:08,046
to make cartilage cells

58
00:01:08,120 --> 00:01:09,528
mature into bone.

59
00:01:09,685 --> 00:01:10,870
Block COX-2,

60
00:01:10,944 --> 00:01:12,500
and that step stalls.

61
00:01:12,611 --> 00:01:13,944
2017:

62
00:01:14,102 --> 00:01:15,139
young rabbits,

63
00:01:15,213 --> 00:01:17,231
25 days of celecoxib.

64
00:01:17,389 --> 00:01:18,593
The mineralisation front

65
00:01:18,667 --> 00:01:19,556
in the femur fell

66
00:01:19,630 --> 00:01:20,444
behind.

67
00:01:20,556 --> 00:01:21,981
2021:

68
00:01:22,056 --> 00:01:23,167
growing mice,

69
00:01:23,241 --> 00:01:24,796
10 weeks of naproxen.

70
00:01:24,954 --> 00:01:26,009
Shorter shin bones.

71
00:01:26,167 --> 00:01:27,296
Shorter thigh bones.

72
00:01:27,454 --> 00:01:28,509
The dividing zone got

73
00:01:28,583 --> 00:01:29,250
thicker,

74
00:01:29,287 --> 00:01:30,380
the maturing zone got

75
00:01:30,454 --> 00:01:31,046
thinner.

76
00:01:31,157 --> 00:01:32,343
So NSAIDs can hit

77
00:01:32,435 --> 00:01:33,417
almost every step of

78
00:01:33,509 --> 00:01:34,509
bone growth.

79
00:01:34,583 --> 00:01:35,694
But here's my take:

80
00:01:35,769 --> 00:01:36,639
these are animal and

81
00:01:36,731 --> 00:01:37,639
cell studies,

82
00:01:37,713 --> 00:01:38,972
mostly with long daily

83
00:01:39,009 --> 00:01:39,861
dosing.

84
00:01:39,935 --> 00:01:40,806
A short course at

85
00:01:40,880 --> 00:01:42,009
normal doses probably

86
00:01:42,083 --> 00:01:43,343
won't shrink you.

87
00:01:43,491 --> 00:01:44,694
And plot twist:

88
00:01:44,769 --> 00:01:45,806
flurbiprofen,

89
00:01:45,963 --> 00:01:46,889
also an NSAID,

90
00:01:46,963 --> 00:01:48,056
boosted bone growth in

91
00:01:48,167 --> 00:01:49,019
young rats.
